<header class="report-header">
  <h1>BIEK Computer Science 12th Class Past Paper Analysis</h1>
  <div class="subtitle">A comprehensive 11-year trend analysis of question types, topic distribution, and structural patterns across BIEK HSC Part-2 examinations (2015–2025)</div>
  <div class="meta">Board of Intermediate Education Karachi &bull; Paper-II (Theory) &bull; 327 Questions Analyzed</div>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <!-- SECTION 1: Dataset & Examination Overview -->
  <div class="section">
    <h2>Dataset & Examination Overview</h2>

    <p>This report analyzes 327 examination questions from the BIEK Computer Science Paper-II (HSC Part-2) spanning 10 examination years between 2015 and 2025. The dataset encompasses three question categories: Multiple Choice Questions (MCQs), Short-answer Questions, and Long-answer Questions, providing a complete view of the theory examination structure.</p>

    <div class="kpi-grid">
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-value">327</div>
        <div class="kpi-label">Total Questions</div>
      </div>
      <div class="kpi-card">
        <div class="kpi-value">10</div>
