    <div class="chart-container">
      <canvas id="chartKeywords"></canvas>
    </div>

    <h3>Topic Domain Frequency (All Years Combined)</h3>
    <p>Each question was matched against 15 predefined topic categories using keyword pattern matching. A single question may match multiple topics (e.g., a question about "for loop operators" matches both "Loops" and "Operators"). The results show the relative emphasis of each topic across the entire dataset.</p>

